00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:58.000
When asked about her nanny, Sabrina Quider claimed she had resigned two days earlier and returned home to France. Police asked for the nanny's name, but Sabrina could only remember her first name, Sophie. She had hired Sophie 18 months prior to help with the children while Wiesem was away for work. This immediately struck the police's odd. After employing and living with Sophie for such a long time, it seemed absurd that Sabrina didn't know her last name. They suspected that Sabrina knew more than she was letting on and took her to the station for further questioning. Given the level of destruction, DNA testing would be required to confirm the identity of the body Wiesem was attempting to destroy. But police was certain it was the

