their son. But this was the first time she had accused him publicly. Sabrina was arrested as a result, and she reluctantly accepted a caution for sending malicious communications. The most recent incident had occurred just one month prior to Sophie Lyonnais' death in August 2017. Sabrina had called police to report that Sophie had taken her son to meet with Mark against her wishes. There, Mark threatened to kill the boy's family. Given Sabrina's previous history of false reports, police didn't believe her, and therefore no action was taken. The following month, Sabrina recorded a dejected and exhausted Sophie at 11.32 am, mere hours before she died. She pressed Sophie to admit that Mark

